{"body":"Fixes # .\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nEnhance the RC handling for MPM run control. To handle the case if the main func already had the RC code, but in case there's remaining thread not been able to clean shutdown, when MPM kill the process, the RC code will be still able to back to the parent process.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Types of changes\r\n<!--- Put an `x` in all the boxes that apply, and remove the not applicable items -->\r\n- [x] Non-breaking change (fix or new feature that would not break existing functionality).\r\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or new feature that would cause existing functionality to change).\r\n- [ ] New tests added to cover the changes.\r\n- [ ] Quick tests passed locally by running `./runtest.sh`.\r\n- [ ] In-line docstrings updated.\r\n- [ ] Documentation updated.\r\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOFy3KIc5mOC1q","author":{"login":"chesterxgchen"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Can you make more explicit description ? for example RC for MPM ?  what is RC, resource control or return code ? MPM ? what it means ","createdAt":"2023-09-12T04:46:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/1985#issuecomment-1714957674","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOFy3KIc5mRBnS","author":{"login":"yhwen"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"> Can you make more explicit description ? for example RC for MPM ? what is RC, resource control or return code ? MPM ? what it means\r\n\r\nAdded more description to describe the function changes.","createdAt":"2023-09-12T13:34:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/1985#issuecomment-1715739090","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOFy3KIc5mfNWV","author":{"login":"yhwen"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"/build","createdAt":"2023-09-14T13:30:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"m